DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270204
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270205
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:ECB rate decision
DESCRIPTION:The first ECB decision of 2027.\n\nA mirror of the ECB calendar
  lists a February 3-4 monetary policy meeting. The ECB's own page wasn't c
 onfirmed in search\, so check the date there. Decisions usually come at 14
 :15 CET.\n\nECB: Governing Council meeting schedules: https://www.ecb.euro
 pa.eu/press/calendars/mgcgc/html/index.en.html\neco3min: ECB meeting calen
 dar: https://eco3min.fr/en/ecb-meeting-calendar/
